{
  "slug": "apollo-skills",
  "name": "Apollo Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Apollo GraphQL agent skills for Claude Code — Apollo Client, Server, Federation, Connectors, Router, Rover CLI, iOS, Kotlin, and the Apollo MCP server. Covers schema design, query optimization, and GraphQL best practices.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **14 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (14): `apollo-client` (Guide for building React applications with Apollo Client 4.x), `apollo-connectors` (Guide for integrating REST APIs into GraphQL supergraphs using Apollo Connectors with @source and @connect directives), `apollo-federation` (Guide for authoring Apollo Federation subgraph schemas), `apollo-ios` (Guide for building Apple-platform applications with Apollo iOS, the strongly-typed GraphQL client for Swift), `apollo-kotlin` (Guide for building applications with Apollo Kotlin, the GraphQL client library for Android and Kotlin), `apollo-mcp-server` (Guide for using Apollo MCP Server to connect AI agents with GraphQL APIs), `apollo-router` (Version-aware guide for configuring and running Apollo Router for federated GraphQL supergraphs), `apollo-router-plugin-creator` (Guide for writing Apollo Router native Rust plugins), and 6 more\n- **MCP servers** (1): `graphos-tools`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install apollo-skills@claude-plugins-official` from `apollographql/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 14,
    "mcp": 1
  },
